5. Truebill/Rocket Money (AI Rewards Optimizer)

Solves one problem: Maximizes credit card points based on actual, personal spending habits.

Target customers: Young professionals and point-hackers.

Infrastructure: Plaid API for bank data and basic app hosting.

Reimagines space: Moves from passive budget tracking to proactive, mathematically optimal card usage advice.

LLM Core: LLM parses messy merchant transaction strings to perfectly categorize spending and recommend the best card to use.

Validation Guardrail: A deterministic calculator computes the actual point yield to verify the LLM's recommendation is actually the highest value.

Self-Correction: If the math proves the LLM wrong, the correct calculation is fed back to the LLM to regenerate its reasoning.

Deployability: Fully deployable as a mobile or web application.
